	<string>주차장 표지판을 촬영해 층과 구역을 제안해 드려요. 사진은 서버로 전송하지 않아요.</string>
	<key>NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription</key>
	<string>선택한 주차장 사진에서 층과 구역을 읽어요.</string>
	<key>NSSupportsLiveActivities</key>
	<true/>
	<key>ITSAppUsesNonExemptEncryption</key>
	<false/>
	<key>CFBundleURLTypes</key>
	<array>
		<dict>
			<key>CFBundleURLSchemes</key>
			<array>
				<string>carcar</string>
				<string>com.kang88.carcar</string>
			</array>
		</dict>
	</array>
	<key>FlutterDeepLinkingEnabled</key>
	<false/>
	<key>WidgetKeychainGroup</key>
	<string>$(AppIdentifierPrefix)com.kang88.carcar.shared</string>
	<key>CarcarAPNsEnvironment</key>
	<string>$(APS_ENVIRONMENT)</string>
